---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Hakomi Sessions Online & on Kauaʻi | Tender of the Soul"
  ><PageHero
    eyebrow="Sessions"
    title="A place to slow down and listen."
    intro="Collaborative, gently paced Hakomi sessions for adults, online or in person from a private home office on Kauaʻi."
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container details">
      <article>
        <span>01</span><h3>60–90 minutes</h3><p>
          Enough time to arrive, follow what is present, and close with care.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span>02</span><h3>Online</h3><p>
          Meet from a private, comfortable place anywhere the service can
          appropriately be offered.
        </p>
      </article><article>
        <span>03</span><h3>In person</h3><p>
          A quiet, private home office on Kauaʻi. Access details are shared
          before your visit.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section soft-panel">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p><h2>Your experience leads.</h2><p>
          A session begins by contacting what feels alive in the present moment.
          Rather than imposing a predetermined agenda, Elana follows your
          unfolding process with you.
        </p><p>
          You might notice sensation, emotion, an image, a memory, a shift in
          breathing, a gesture, or words that seem to carry particular weight.
          There is no correct way to experience a session.
        </p>
      </div><ol class="flow">
        <li><span>Arrive</span><p>We begin with what is here today.</p></li><li>
          <span>Notice</span><p>
            Attention gently turns toward present-moment experience.
          </p>
        </li><li>
          <span>Follow</span><p>
            We stay curious about what unfolds, without forcing.
          </p>
        </li><li>
          <span>Integrate</span><p>
            We make space to orient and close with steadiness.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container grid-2">
      <div class="quote">
        <p>
          “Nothing needs to be pushed open. You remain an active participant in
          every part of the process.”
        </p>
      </div><div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Choice remains with you</p><h2>
          You can pause at any time.
        </h2><p>
          We work collaboratively. You can ask questions, change direction, slow
          down, or stop. Protective responses are approached with respect, not
          treated as resistance.
        </p><p>
          No previous experience with mindfulness, somatic work, or therapy is
          needed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section first">
    <div class="narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your first session</p><h2>
        An invitation to experience yourself differently.
      </h2><p class="lead">
        The first session offers a compassionate place to slow down, connect
        with what is alive inside, and begin noticing what may be asking to
        move, soften, or be met.
      </p><p>
        There is no expectation of a dramatic breakthrough. We will also make
        room for questions, context, and a conversation about what support might
        feel useful.
      </p><a class="button" href="/contact">Begin a Conversation</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .details article {
    padding: 2rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .details span {
    color: var(--clay-dark);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
  }
  .details h3 {
    margin: 2rem 0 0.8rem;
  }
  .flow {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    counter-reset: item;
  }
  .flow li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.6fr 1fr;
    padding: 1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .flow span {
    font: 1.5rem var(--serif);
  }
  .first {
    background: var(--mist);
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .details {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .details article {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
  }
</style>
